ements, better gameplay, a new view of the experience that changes the game a lot. To enjoy the latest version, you’ll need to start a new game. We apologize for the inconvenience and appreciate your understanding! We ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:59:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694948","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:50:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1846651706694945","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"update","title":"Saves in Patch 1.0.3","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 Important Information About Save Files 🔧 Due to changes to some gameplay mechanics and improvements to the interaction system, save files from previous versions of It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator will not be compatible with the latest update 1.0.3 Patch. We understand that this means some of you may need to start your game from the beginning. This wasn't a decision we made lightly, but these changes are an important step in the continued development and improvement of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:59:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706694945","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:50:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1846651706691353","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"Join us on Steam Next Fest!","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 We're happy to announce that It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator is part of Steam Next Fest: October 2026 Edition! 🔥 {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45681857/493dbace1310736695c938bba2419532ecef3cc9.png We're excited to be part of this event and can't wait for you to try out what we've prepared! Jump into the Demo, grab your tools, and see if you have what it takes to repair electronics and get everything working again! 🔧 https://store.steampowered.com/app/3787060/It_Works_Electronics","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:00:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691353","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1845383656393010","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"The Heart of Auctions!","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 We've already shown you the second location and some of the new possibilities it brings to your business. Today, it's time to take a closer look at the one we mentioned recently. Auctions! 💰 Once you purchase the second location, you'll gain access to a completely new way of making money. Inside you'll find a computer that will give you access to take part in auctions. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45681857/41ba4b302bdad84a89d3bac775f843fcbd3f3bcc.png You will have to think how much yo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T09:49:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656393010","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1845383656377724","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"First Short Circuit is Coming Soon!","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 Your feedback on the game from previous playtests and demo has been absolutely astounding! 🔥 We heard every word, got every electric shock ⚡, every equipment malfunction from you. We want to make a game that will truly be the culmination of our work and your feedback and we want to announce another episode in It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator! 🎉 It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator - First Short Circuit is Coming Soon! 🚨 Wishlist NOW! 👇 https://store.steampowered.com/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T13:58:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377724","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1842212951302632","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"A Bit of Luck!","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 The Demo is here, but it is not the end of Devlogs, now is time for some news of what more is coming to the game! 📰 Grab your tools, put on your magnifying glasses, it is time to inspect what works. The first location you experienced in the Playtest is not the only place you will work in. If you earn enough money, expand your business far enough, you can get a proper building for yourself! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45681857/0a36ae559a13b441c9b1f676ae43b29dff8b6772.png The second lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T09:44:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951302632","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1840944183779600","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"update","title":"Patch 1.0.2","summary":"🔧 New Update! 🔧 We’ve just released another update for It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator, bringing more fixes based on your feedback! 🎮 Patch notes: D-Pad Fixed – The D-pad testing issue has been fixed. Gamepad Interaction Blocker Fixed – Fixed an issue that could prevent you from progressing after interacting with the gamepad. Thank you for all your reports and feedback! We’re working hard to fix issues as quickly as possible and make the game a better experience for everyone. ❤️ See you i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T13:19:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779600","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1840944183776984","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"update","title":"Patch 1.0.1","summary":"🔧New Update!🔧 We’ve just released a new update with a couple of fixes based on your feedback! 🎮 Patch notes: Gamepad Testing – You can now exit the gamepad testing screen even if the controller wasn’t fully repaired before testing. This lets you return to the repair process and fix any remaining issues. Screwdriver Controls – We’ve corrected the screw rotation! Turning the screwdriver clockwise now tightens the screw, while turning it counterclockwise loosens it Thank you for all your feedback a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T14:41:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1840944183776272","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"⚡ The Demo is LIVE! Grab your soldering irons! ⚡","summary":"The fire extinguisher is optional... but highly recommended! 🔥 Hello Technicians! 👋 The day has finally arrived! We have been saying \"It works on our end\" for months, and now it's time to see if it actually works on yours. We are incredibly thrilled to announce that the It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator Demo is officially LIVE and ready to play! ⚡ https://store.steampowered.com/app/3787060/It_Works_Electronics_Repair_Simulator_Demo/ What’s waiting for you in the workshop? We’ve prepared a h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T09:52:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1840310314339259","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release Date is HERE!","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 The wait is almost over! ⏳ The workbench is set up 🔧 the soldering iron is heating up, and a stack of electronics is waiting to be brought back to life... We are excited to announce that the It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator Demo is coming on August 13, 2026! ⚡ https://store.steampowered.com/app/3787060/It_Works_Electronics_Repair_Simulator_Demo/ {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45681857/cfc5d5035ee10ff544ea583dc2fc61d8e75cbab4.png Get ready to open up a vast array of electronic devi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T14:01:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314339259","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1839676055887931","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"We are at ChinaJoy 2026!","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 The soldering stations are hot and ready! 🔥 We are officially LIVE at ChinaJoy 2026! Our booth is fully set up, and the very first players are already testing their electronics repair skills in our exclusive on-site build of It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator. When: Right now! (July 31 – August 3, 2026) Where: Booth G692 {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45681857/fe39f7e19d1b57aadfc2875ee4fafceb9bb6e857.png If you are attending the event in Shanghai, don't miss your chance to grab a vi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-31T11:51:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055887931","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1838407329265635","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"It Works is coming to ChinaJoy!","summary":"\"It works on my end!\"... but does it work in Shanghai? Hello Technicians! 👋 We are super excited to announce that It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator is heading to ChinaJoy 2026! When: July 31 – August 3, 2026 Where: Booth G692 Play at the booth! 🖥️ Drop by our booth, grab a virtual soldering iron, and play our exclusive on-site build! Let's see if you can diagnose the faults and fix the electronics without setting our booth on fire! 🔥 {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45681857/c37f96ff0581ca454fca58dd78359","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T14:16:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329265635","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1838407329256600","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"Second Playtest has Ended!","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 The Second Playtest has officially come to an end. Thank you for taking part! 🤝 We'd like to sincerely thank everyone who joined the Second Playtest and shared their time with us. Thanks to your reports, suggestions, and feedback, we've gathered an incredible amount of valuable information that will help us make It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator even better. Every repair you completed, every bug you reported, and every idea you shared has helped us understand what works","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T13:00:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329256600","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1837955055363357","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"Second Playtest is Finishing!","summary":"Hello Technicians! 👋 Our Second Playtest has been running for some time now, and thanks to all of you we've gathered a huge amount of valuable feedback, bug reports, and suggestions. 🛠️ Your participation has been a tremendous help as we continue developing It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator. 🤝 The Playtest 2 will officially come to an end on July 16, 2026 at 3:00 PM CEST ⏰ https://store.steampowered.com/app/3787050/It_Works_Electronics_Repair_Simulator/ Every repair you've completed, every ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-13T12:47:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055363357","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1836506165562271","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"Software Incoming!","summary":"Hello Technicians!👋 First of all, thank you all for playing the Second Playtest for It Works: Electronics Repair Simulator! Your time spent testing the game and all the feedback we’ve received from you will help us immensely in pushing the game to its highest potential.🙏 If you haven't played the Playtest yet, we invite you to experience it for yourself! 🎮 https://store.steampowered.com/app/3787050/It_Works_Electronics_Repair_Simulator/ Recently, we have been focusing heavily on hardware repairs","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T11:45:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562271","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3787050-1836506165548667","game_id":"steam-3787050","kind":"announcement","title":"Second Playtest has STARTED!","summary":"Hello Technicians! The time for It Works has arrived! The Second P